{"title": "Duck", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Duck</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Duck.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Duck.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Duck.jpg/250px-Duck.jpg?a945e7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Duck.jpg/375px-Duck.jpg?a945e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Duck.jpg/500px-Duck.jpg?a945e7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nRed Pill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nDuck</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n60</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nBlast</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nCan't Open Doors</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nImmune</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Duck</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Red_Pill\">Red Pill</a>, an unused vanilla entity, added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is literally just a large a rubber ducky.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Duck</b> always knows where players are and will attempt to move towards the closest player regardless of location. For example, if a player is in the interior and the <b>Duck</b> is on the exterior, it will still attempt to path as close as it can to the player in the interior. This makes the <b>Duck</b> behave similarly to a permanently active Jester, but its movement is similar to that of a Thumper, rapidly accelerating while moving and having to slow down to make turns.\n</p><p>The <b>Duck</b> is technically killable and stunnable, but lacks an actual hitbox and is completely invulnerable in-game. Likewise the <b>Duck</b> technically has a Door Speed Multiplier of 1, but is incapable of opening doors in-game. Any player that comes into contact with the middle of the <b>Duck</b> will violently explode into chunks and their body can not be recovered.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Duck</b> has a 33.33% chance to spawn in the interior, on the exterior, and on the exterior during daytime on <a href=\"/wiki/Duckstroid-14\" title=\"Duckstroid-14\"><b>Duckstroid-14</b></a>, exclusively spawning on this moon.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ambient_Noise\">Ambient Noise</span></h3>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"DuckNoiseInGame.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/DuckNoiseInGame.mp3?ca189a\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/DuckNoiseInGame.mp3/DuckNoiseInGame.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DuckDoor.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Duck stuck on a door.\"><img alt=\"The Duck stuck on a door.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DuckDoor.jpg/120px-DuckDoor.jpg?9ed02f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DuckDoor.jpg/180px-DuckDoor.jpg?9ed02f 1.5x, /images/thumb/DuckDoor.jpg/240px-DuckDoor.jpg?9ed02f 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Duck stuck on a door.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DuckExterior.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Duck reaching the outskirts of the exterior in an attempt to reach a player in the interior.\"><img alt=\"The Duck reaching the outskirts of the exterior in an attempt to reach a player in the interior.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DuckExterior.jpg/120px-DuckExterior.jpg?278ed6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DuckExterior.jpg/180px-DuckExterior.jpg?278ed6 1.5x, /images/thumb/DuckExterior.jpg/240px-DuckExterior.jpg?278ed6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Duck reaching the outskirts of the exterior in an attempt to reach a player in the interior.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The exploded body of a player after being killed by the Duck.\"><img alt=\"The exploded body of a player after being killed by the Duck.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg/120px-DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg?5dbd92\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg/180px-DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg?5dbd92 1.5x, /images/thumb/DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg/240px-DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg?5dbd92 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The exploded body of a player after being killed by the Duck.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Duck.jpg", "DuckDoor.jpg", "DuckExterior.jpg", "DuckCorpsexplosion.jpg", "DuckNoiseInGame.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}